## Important Details
- Program scope (from `scope.yml`): ONLY `box.signageos.io` and `api.signageos.io` are eligible
- Long exclusion list: DoS, descriptive errors/headers, public file/dir disclosure, outdated libs, OPTIONS/TRACE, CSRF on logout/anonymous forms, cookie flags on non-sensitive data, self-XSS, scanner reports without POC, username enumeration, brute-force/lockout, SSL/TLS, clickjacking w/o exploit, mail config, known-vulnerable libs, password policies, autocomplete, public login panels, email verification gaps, session control on email/password changes
- Reportable focus: real logic flaws with concrete POC on the two eligible hosts
