<div class="indent">
<span id="url-target-bookmarklet">???</span>
</div>

<p>bookmarklet url in a pre:
<pre id="target-bookmarklet-src-pre"></pre>

<p>bookmarklet url in a textarea:
<div class="indent">
<textarea id="target-bookmarklet-src-text-area"></textarea>
</div>

